- never give 0 or 1 answer incorrectly (i.e., never return 0 if input state was ![image](https://espresso.codeforces.com/891b1e75c93e44f237b7fde497062f8e85c1d952.png) and never return 1 if input state was ![image](https://espresso.codeforces.com/c1f9019c20fc8a9610d31c36ba7860cef0b7c55c.png)),
