- correctly identify ![image](https://espresso.codeforces.com/c1f9019c20fc8a9610d31c36ba7860cef0b7c55c.png) state at least 10% of the times,
- correctly identify ![image](https://espresso.codeforces.com/891b1e75c93e44f237b7fde497062f8e85c1d952.png) state at least 10% of the times.

In each test ![image](https://espresso.codeforces.com/c1f9019c20fc8a9610d31c36ba7860cef0b7c55c.png) and ![image](https://espresso.codeforces.com/891b1e75c93e44f237b7fde497062f8e85c1d952.png) states will be provided with 50% probability.

